{"text":"purananuru","n":87,"lines":["களம்புகல் ஓம்புமின் தெவ்விர் போர் எதிர்ந்து","எம்முளும் உளன்ஒரு பொருநன் வைகல்","எண் தேர் செய்யும் தச்சன்","திங்கள் வலித்த கால்அன் னோனே"],"tr":["kaḷampukal ōmpumiṉ tevvir pōr etirntu","emmuḷum uḷaṉoru porunaṉ vaikal","eṇ tēr ceyyum taccaṉ","tiṅkaḷ valitta kālaṉ ṉōṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"tumpai","tinai_ta":"தும்பை","turai_ta":"தானை மறம்","poet_ta":"ஔவையார்","addressed_ta":"அதியமான் நெடுமானஞ்சி","poet_tr":"Auvaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"களம்புக","tr":"kaḷampuka","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"களம்","tr":"kaḷam"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புக","tr":"puka"}]},{"text":"லோம்புமின்","tr":"lōmpumiṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோம்","tr":"lōm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புமின்","tr":"pumiṉ"}]},{"text":"தெவ்விர்","tr":"tevvir","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தெவ்","tr":"tev"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"விர்","tr":"vir"}]},{"text":"போரெதிர்ந்","tr":"pōretirn","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரெதிர்ந்","tr":"retirn"}]}],[{"text":"தெம்முளு","tr":"temmuḷu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தெம்","tr":"tem"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முளு","tr":"muḷu"}]},{"text":"முளனொரு","tr":"muḷaṉoru","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முள","tr":"muḷa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னொரு","tr":"ṉoru"}]},{"text":"பொருநன்","tr":"porunaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொரு","tr":"poru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]},{"text":"வைக","tr":"vaika","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]}],[{"text":"லெண்தேர்","tr":"leṇtēr","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லெண்","tr":"leṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேர்","tr":"tēr"}]},{"text":"செய்யும்","tr":"ceyyum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"தச்சன்","tr":"taccaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தச்","tr":"tac"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சன்","tr":"caṉ"}]}],[{"text":"திங்கள்","tr":"tiṅkaḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"திங்","tr":"tiṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கள்","tr":"kaḷ"}]},{"text":"வலித்த","tr":"valitta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வலித்","tr":"valit"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"காலன்","tr":"kālaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லன்","tr":"laṉ"}]},{"text":"னோனே","tr":"ṉōṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"களம்புகல்","parts":[{"text":"களம்","lemma":"களம்","gloss":"battlefield"},{"text":"புகல்","lemma":"புகல்","gloss":"entering"}],"gloss":"entering the battlefield"},{"surface":"ஓம்புமின்","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பு","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"avoid"},{"text":"மின்","lemma":"மின்","gloss":"plural imperative suffix"}],"gloss":"avoid / beware"},{"surface":"தெவ்விர்","parts":[{"text":"தெவ்விர்","lemma":"தெவ்வர்","gloss":"enemies (vocative)"}],"gloss":"O enemies!"},{"surface":"போர்","parts":[{"text":"போர்","lemma":"போர்","gloss":"war"}],"gloss":"war"},{"surface":"எதிர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"எதிர்ந்து","lemma":"எதிர்ந்து","gloss":"confronting"}],"gloss":"confronting","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எம்முளும்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"யாம்","gloss":"our"},{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"among"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even among us"},{"surface":"உளன்","parts":[{"text":"உளன்","lemma":"உளன்","gloss":"he exists"}],"gloss":"he exists"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"one"},{"surface":"பொருநன்","parts":[{"text":"பொருநன்","lemma":"பொருநன்","gloss":"warrior"}],"gloss":"warrior"},{"surface":"வைகல்","parts":[{"text":"வைகல்","lemma":"வைகல்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"day"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எண்","parts":[{"text":"எண்","lemma":"எண்","gloss":"eight"}],"gloss":"eight"},{"surface":"தேர்","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"chariots"},{"surface":"செய்யும்","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"make"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"who makes"},{"surface":"தச்சன்","parts":[{"text":"தச்சன்","lemma":"தச்சன்","gloss":"carpenter"}],"gloss":"carpenter"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திங்கள்","parts":[{"text":"திங்கள்","lemma":"திங்கள்","gloss":"month"}],"gloss":"month"},{"surface":"வலித்த","parts":[{"text":"வலி","lemma":"வலி","gloss":"strengthen / fashion with effort"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"adjective marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"fashioned with effort over"},{"surface":"கால்","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"wheel"}],"gloss":"wheel"},{"surface":"அன்னோனே","parts":[{"text":"அன்னோன்","lemma":"அன்னோன்","gloss":"he who is like"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"he is like that"}]}],"literal":"Entering the battlefield, avoid, O enemies, confronting in war! / Even among us, there exists a warrior, who is like / a carpenter who makes eight chariots a day, / but spends a whole month fashioning a single wheel!","translation":"O enemies! Avoid entering the battlefield to confront us in war. Even among us, there is a warrior. He is like a wheel crafted over a whole month by a carpenter who otherwise makes eight chariots in a single day!","modern":"பகைவர்களே! போர்க்களத்தில் எங்களை எதிர்த்துப் போரிட வருவதைத் தவிர்த்துக்கொள்ளுங்கள். எங்களிடமும் ஒரு சிறந்த வீரன் இருக்கிறான். அவன் எத்தகையவன் என்றால், ஒரு நாளில் எட்டுத் தேர்களைச் செய்யும் தச்சன் ஒருவன், ஒரு முழு மாத காலம் எடுத்துக்கொண்டு மிக நுட்பமாகவும் வலிமையாகவும் செய்த ஒரு தேரின் சக்கரத்தைப் போன்றவன் ஆவான்.","explanation":"In this poem, the poet Avvaiyar addresses the enemies of King Adhiyaman Neduman Anji, warning them not to wage war against him. She employs a striking and memorable simile from the craft of carpentry to illustrate the king's peerless strength. A skilled carpenter is capable of mass-producing eight ordinary chariots in a single day. However, when that same master craftsman dedicates an entire month to fashioning just a single wheel, that wheel is built with unmatched precision, density, and indestructible strength. Adhiyaman is compared to this meticulously crafted wheel, implying that his strength is concentrated, flawless, and impossible to break in battle. The key words are 'தெவ்விர்' (enemies), 'பொருநன்' (warrior), 'தச்சன்' (carpenter), and 'கால்' (wheel).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}